WEBVTT

00:04:58.196 --> 00:05:00.751
na kuiweka kati kwenye siasa zetu

00:05:01.272 --> 00:05:06.295
Tunafaa kukumbuaka kazi
sio tu kupata riziki,

00:05:06.319 --> 00:05:09.744
ila pia ni kuchangia 
uzuri wa pamoja

00:05:09.768 --> 00:05:12.542
na kushindania utambuzi wakati huo

00:05:13.030 --> 00:05:16.672
Robert F. Kennedy alisema vyema
nusu karne iliyopita

00:05:17.117 --> 00:05:20.800
Ushirika,jumuiya, uzalendo shirika

00:05:21.438 --> 00:05:24.772
Malengo haya hayaji

00:05:24.796 --> 00:05:27.667
kwa ununuzi na ulaji 
wa bidhaa pamoja.

00:05:28.863 --> 00:05:31.347
Zinatokana na ajira adhama,